<title>SWITZERLAND: ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP SLALOM FIRST-LEG TIMES.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP SLALOM FIRST-LEG TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>LAAX, Switzerland 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings after the first leg of a women's Alpine skiing World Cup slalom on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Claudia Riegler (New Zealand) 38.55 seconds</p>
<p>2. Elfi Eder (Austria)	     38.72</p>
<p>3. Patricia Chauvet (France)     38.85</p>
<p>4. Pernilla Wiberg (Sweden)	38.86</p>
<p>5. Martina Accola (Switzerland)  38.87</p>
<p>6. Sabine Egger (Austria)	  38.96</p>
<p>7 equal. Leila Piccard (France)  38.97</p>
<p>7 equal. Lara Magoni (Italy)     38.97</p>
<p>9. Sonja Nef (Switzerland)	 38.99</p>
<p>10. Trine Bakke (Norway)	   39.18</p>
